{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunkfrat</strong> is a fast-paced first-person shooter where you face off your enemies in linear missions and reclaim your <strong>almighty frat beverages</strong>. These legendary drinks are pretty important for Hunkfrat's diet and anyone foolish enough to steal them must pay the  price!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819000/extras/bceccb0f523dc813a64443dd9bbfed12.poster.avif?t=1764176871\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819000/extras/bceccb0f523dc813a64443dd9bbfed12.webm?t=1764176871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819000/extras/bceccb0f523dc813a64443dd9bbfed12.mp4?t=1764176871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunkfrat offers a responsive and dynamic combat. Use your beloved Glock-17 pistol and your other abilities such as\u00a0<strong>slow-motion and dash\u00a0</strong>to take down your enemies. Every encounter will reward you with money, and you can spend this money to <strong>upgrade your character </strong>and<strong> improve your weapon\u00a0</strong>that will make you deadlier within each level.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819000/extras/caf6093cadd3814e63cdc1dbd194eafa.poster.avif?t=1764176871\" width=608 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819000/extras/caf6093cadd3814e63cdc1dbd194eafa.webm?t=1764176871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819000/extras/caf6093cadd3814e63cdc1dbd194eafa.mp4?t=1764176871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you go on, you\u2019ll face increasingly challenging enemies, that will force you to combine reflexes with clever use of mechanics. But even that might not be enough in some cases, and that's where the upgrade system comes into play. Upgrades allow you to both advance your<strong> character </strong>and your<strong> gun. </strong>And thanks to them you can increase your stats such as damage, reload speed, health etc. And you can also buy <strong>Perks </strong>for your gun. These perks will give a more unique look to your weapon and they will also help you significantly for a better feel of combat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Tone &amp; Style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the action is intense, Hunkfrat doesn\u2019t take itself too seriously. Expect <strong>a funny story</strong> that make the journey as entertaining as the combat itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re looking for a <strong>fun, chaotic, and replayable FPS</strong> with a mix of <strong>humor, upgrades, and fast-paced action</strong>, then it\u2019s time to join the fight and get back your almighty frat beverages at all costs!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3819000?t=1764176871","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3819000?t=1764176871","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819000/17781c3e6ab28e9d542192e4a839e65fc2370287/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764176871","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819000/17781c3e6ab28e9d542192e4a839e65fc2370287/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764176871","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game contains depictions of blood, violence, and death, as well as strong language. It also includes references to alcohol, tobacco, and illegal drugs. All such elements are presented in a humorous and exaggerated tone and does not induce usage of any elements referred. The game does not include nudity, sexual content, or extreme violence."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunkfrat</strong> is a fast-paced first-person shooter where you face off your enemies in linear missions and reclaim your <strong>almighty frat beverages</strong>. These legendary drinks are pretty important for Hunkfrat's diet and anyone foolish enough to steal them must pay the  price!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819000/extras/bceccb0f523dc813a64443dd9bbfed12.poster.avif?t=1764176871\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819000/extras/bceccb0f523dc813a64443dd9bbfed12.webm?t=1764176871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819000/extras/bceccb0f523dc813a64443dd9bbfed12.mp4?t=1764176871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunkfrat offers a responsive and dynamic combat. Use your beloved Glock-17 pistol and your other abilities such as\u00a0<strong>slow-motion and dash\u00a0</strong>to take down your enemies. Every encounter will reward you with money, and you can spend this money to <strong>upgrade your character </strong>and<strong> improve your weapon\u00a0</strong>that will make you deadlier within each level.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819000/extras/caf6093cadd3814e63cdc1dbd194eafa.poster.avif?t=1764176871\" width=608 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819000/extras/caf6093cadd3814e63cdc1dbd194eafa.webm?t=1764176871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819000/extras/caf6093cadd3814e63cdc1dbd194eafa.mp4?t=1764176871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you go on, you\u2019ll face increasingly challenging enemies, that will force you to combine reflexes with clever use of mechanics. But even that might not be enough in some cases, and that's where the upgrade system comes into play. Upgrades allow you to both advance your<strong> character </strong>and your<strong> gun. </strong>And thanks to them you can increase your stats such as damage, reload speed, health etc. And you can also buy <strong>Perks </strong>for your gun. These perks will give a more unique look to your weapon and they will also help you significantly for a better feel of combat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Tone &amp; Style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the action is intense, Hunkfrat doesn\u2019t take itself too seriously. Expect <strong>a funny story</strong> that make the journey as entertaining as the combat itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re looking for a <strong>fun, chaotic, and replayable FPS</strong> with a mix of <strong>humor, upgrades, and fast-paced action</strong>, then it\u2019s time to join the fight and get back your almighty frat beverages at all costs!</p>","developers":["Hayali Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819000/dbd47cce84b1e61165f506c353ab503b29697406/header.jpg?t=1764176871","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3819000/1702207293/7cf2fa41f950ea9e33e5155dbbfeee2ab441720b/1760204264/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760204885","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3819000/1702207293/7cf2fa41f950ea9e33e5155dbbfeee2ab441720b/1760204264/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760204885","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3819000/1702207293/7cf2fa41f950ea9e33e5155dbbfeee2ab441720b/1760204264/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760204885","id":257216152,"name":"Hunkfrat Trailer 0","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257216152/1eef6e3cf5f351ac0dfecc5cb60a00ccba1e31d8/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760204885"}],"name":"Hunkfrat","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10-11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel I3 10100f / Amd Ryzen 3 3100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce Gtx 1070 8GB / Amd Rx 580 8GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Hayali Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drogas il\u00edcitas\nLinguagem impr\u00f3pria\nViol\u00eancia","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drogen\nDrastische Gewalt\nDerbe Sprache","rating":"16","rating_g